<view class="page">
  <nav-bar title="画我的蛋壳"></nav-bar>
  <scroll-view class="content" scroll-y>
    <view class="preview">
      <view class="preview-aura"></view>
      <view class="egg-canvas-stack">
        <canvas type="2d" id="eggBaseCanvas" class="egg-canvas egg-canvas--base"></canvas>
        <canvas
          type="2d"
          id="eggArtCanvas"
          class="egg-canvas egg-canvas--art"
          disable-scroll
          catchtouchstart="onCanvasTouchStart"
          catchtouchmove="onCanvasTouchMove"
          catchtouchend="onCanvasTouchEnd"
          catchtouchcancel="onCanvasTouchCancel"
        ></canvas>
      </view>
      <text wx:if="{{!canvasReady}}" class="canvas-loading">正在准备蛋壳…</text>
      <text wx:else class="preview-name">{{selectedColorName}} · {{operationCount > 0 ? '已经留下小记号' : '还没有小记号'}}</text>
    </view>

    <view class="section">
      <text class="label">蛋壳颜色</text>
      <text class="section-note">颜色会轻轻透过原有高光，不会盖住蛋宝宝的立体感。</text>
      <view class="color-grid">
        <view
          wx:for="{{colors}}"
          wx:key="token"
          class="color-item"
          data-token="{{item.token}}"
          aria-role="button"
          aria-label="{{item.name}}"
          bindtap="onColor"
        >
          <view class="swatch {{selectedColor === item.value ? 'swatch--selected' : ''}}" style="background:{{item.value}};"></view>
          <text>{{item.name}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="section">
      <text class="label">添加图样 / 贴纸</text>
      <text class="section-note">可以放一个贴纸，也可以让同一种图样轻轻散落在蛋壳上。</text>
      <view class="placement-row">
        <view class="placement {{patternPlacement === 'single' ? 'placement--selected' : ''}}" data-placement="single" aria-role="button" bindtap="onPatternPlacement">单个贴纸</view>
        <view class="placement {{patternPlacement === 'repeat' ? 'placement--selected' : ''}}" data-placement="repeat" aria-role="button" bindtap="onPatternPlacement">散落图样</view>
      </view>
      <view class="pattern-row">
        <view
          wx:for="{{patterns}}"
          wx:key="type"
          class="pattern {{selectedPattern === item.type ? 'pattern--selected' : ''}}"
          data-pattern="{{item.type}}"
          aria-role="button"
          aria-label="添加{{item.name}}"
          bindtap="onPattern"
        >
          <text class="pattern-symbol">{{item.symbol}}</text>
          <text>{{item.name}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="section">
      <text class="label">亲手画一点</text>
      <text class="section-note">只有一种圆润笔触。橡皮擦只擦掉图样和笔迹；选择“调整贴纸”后，可以按住贴纸移动。</text>
      <view class="tool-row">
        <view class="tool {{activeTool === 'brush' ? 'tool--selected' : ''}}" data-tool="brush" aria-role="button" aria-label="圆形画笔" bindtap="onTool">
          <view class="tool-dot"></view><text>画笔</text>
        </view>
        <view class="tool {{activeTool === 'eraser' ? 'tool--selected' : ''}}" data-tool="eraser" aria-role="button" aria-label="橡皮擦" bindtap="onTool">
          <view class="eraser-icon"></view><text>橡皮擦</text>
        </view>
        <view class="tool {{activeTool === 'sticker' ? 'tool--selected' : ''}}" data-tool="sticker" aria-role="button" aria-label="调整贴纸" bindtap="onTool">
          <view class="sticker-icon">✦</view><text>调整贴纸</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="edit-row">
        <view class="edit-action {{!canUndo ? 'edit-action--disabled' : ''}}" aria-role="button" aria-label="撤销" bindtap="onUndo">撤销</view>
        <view class="edit-action {{!canDeleteSticker ? 'edit-action--disabled' : ''}}" aria-role="button" aria-label="删除所选贴纸" bindtap="onDeleteSticker">删除贴纸</view>
        <view class="edit-action {{!canClear ? 'edit-action--disabled' : ''}}" aria-role="button" aria-label="清空" bindtap="onClear">清空</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <button class="primary" disabled="{{saving || !canvasReady}}" bindtap="onSave">
      <text class="button-label">{{saving ? '正在保存…' : '保存我的蛋壳'}}</text>
    </button>
    <text class="save-note">保存后，首页窝里的蛋宝宝会立即变成这个样子。</text>
  </scroll-view>
</view>
